% expect-output: 2
% expect-output: 3
% expect-output: 900
% expect-output: 0
% oracle: skip other interpreters may clamp small cache values to a minimum
% Scenario: the cache operators read and write the user parameters.
mark 1 2 3 setcacheparams
currentuserparams dup /MinFontCompress get = /MaxFontItem get =
900 setcachelimit
currentcacheparams = pop pop pop
count =
